@local/dsh-balance README · Configuration：Open **Plugin manager → Plugins → DeepSeek Balance → Configuration**. The fields
are volatile host configuration, so a save takes effect on the next refresh
without reloading the plugin.

@local/dsh-balance README · Build pipeline：`src/client.tsx` is bundled by esbuild to CommonJS (`react`, `react/jsx-runtime`,
`react-dom`, `@deepseek-ai/cordis`, `zod` and the rest of the web frontend's
`staticModules` stay external), then `scripts/build-client.mjs` wraps it in the
browser module-system factory:

```js
window.__ModuleLoader__.load({
  id: '@local/dsh-balance',
  factory: (require) => {
    var module = { exports: {} }

@local/dsh-balance README · 刷新策略：**缓存**：`localStorage` 键 `@local/dsh-balance/cache/v1`，内容为
`{ wallets: { value, bonusWallets }, fetchedAt }`，不过期；冷启动先显示缓存值与
相对时间，再由后台读取覆盖。

